<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mensagem do Dia</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #fff0f3;
            font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 15px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(255, 143, 171, 0.2);
            padding: 48px;
            border: 2px solid #ffb3c6;
        }
        .card-title {
            font-family: "Lucida Sans", "Lucida Grande", "Lucida Sans Unicode", sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            color: #c9184a;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            margin-top: 0;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        hr {
            margin: 24px 0;
            border: 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #ffccd5;
        }
        .frase {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #590d22;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .autor {
            font-family: "Lucida Sans", "Lucida Grande", "Lucida Sans Unicode", sans-serif;
            color: #a4133c;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: "Lucida Sans", "Lucida Grande", "Lucida Sans Unicode", sans-serif;
            background-color: #ff4d6d;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(255, 77, 109, 0.3);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h1 class="card-title">🌸 Mensagem do Dia</h1>
            <hr>
            <p class="frase">"<%= frase %>"</p>
            <p class="autor">— Ron Swanson</p>
            <a href="/" class="btn">Nova Mensagem</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
